    "title": "Money, gun, passports found on beach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "KEY LARGO — A beachgoer found a black bag containing $51,550 in Cuban currency, a loaded Glock handgun, passports and a cell phone at 2:36 p.m. Monday, Aug. 4, at the Seafarer Resort and Beach near mile marker 97, bayside, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office. Deputies turned the items over to the U.S. Border Patrol.",
